  "description": "\"I love that you can't leave my side.\"\n\nDoyul, the heir to the Gumiho family, and Jaehyun, the second son of the Wolf family, who grew up together since childhood.\n\nThe two of them have a secret.\n\nThe fact that Doyul forced Jaehyun to eat the Gumiho bead so that he could not leave him.\n\nDoyul, who can only obtain vital energy through Jaehyun because of this, and Jaehyun, who suffers while being with him while hiding his unrequited love for Doyul.\n\nJaehyun tries to come to terms with his feelings before Doyul takes a partner as the family's heir.\n\nMeanwhile, the Wolf and Nine-Tailed Fox clans, the two most powerful among the beastkin families, maintain a friendly relationship on the surface but keep each other in check.\n\nJaehyun, sensing something suspicious about Doyul's father, Assemblyman Lee, enters the Gumiho family's research institute to investigate.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/leasched_fox) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish (Sep 22)",
